[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to a Buffer Overflow vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the code does not adequately ensure that the file content being read into the `buf` buffer does not exceed its allocated size (`BUF_SIZE`). Specifically, the calculation of the remaining space (`BUF_SIZE - 14`) assumes that the prefix and file content together will always fit within the buffer, but there is no explicit check to prevent an overflow if the file content exceeds the available space. This could lead to memory corruption, undefined behavior, or exploitation by an attacker to execute arbitrary code.

